{"findings":[{"rule_id":"NASA-047","evidence":[{"kind":"note","ref":"N15","page":1,"quote":"MTC REPORT REQURIED NON DESTRUCTIVE TESTING RAW MATERIAL UT HEAT TREATMENT DP+UT FINISH COMPOMENT MPI"}],"comment":"Note N15 requires penetrant (DP) and ultrasonic (UT) testing after heat treatment but before finish machining, yet no separate note explicitly instructs that these inspections must be performed prior to the final machining operations. Without this instruction the shop may finish-machine the shaft first, hiding subsurface defects or removing the surface needed for a valid penetrant test. Add a note stating that DP and UT inspection shall be completed before finish machining."
  ,
  "recommended_correction":"Add a note such as 'PERFORM DP AND UT INSPECTION AFTER HEAT TREATMENT AND BEFORE FINISH MACHINING' to make the required sequence unambiguous."}]}
